{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_04",
  "title": "機獸咆哮",
  "storyCode": "RI-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3153d77378d6545a9ae69c8f3520c309a74775a000d424e02625d895fb04b352",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "text": "森蚺，森蚺！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "text": "把他們全都解決掉，森蚺！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人C",
      "text": "大酋長，大酋長！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人D",
      "text": "森蚺，娶我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯勇士",
      "text": "......森蚺，你果然來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯勇士",
      "text": "我還以為你縮在自己的雨林裡不敢來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "雨林很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯勇士",
      "text": "哼，縮在雨林裡的提亞卡烏都是膽小鬼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "是不是膽小鬼，你馬上就知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "祖瑪瑪這傢伙，雖然身上多了些奇怪的裝備，還是和以前一樣啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "哦，博士，我還沒詳細給你介紹過吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "台上那個女孩叫祖瑪瑪，我們不是一個部族，不過以前離得比較近，年紀又差不多，算是一起長大的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "這傢伙雖然不愛說話，但其實也挺厲害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "不過不知道什麼時候起，她就變得怪怪的，雖然還是很能打，但是沒事的時候會老是自己在搗鼓一些怪東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "在那之後她部族搬走了，我們就見的比較少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "聽說她還是很厲害，但是好像染上了怪病，會對沒人的地方說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "我在羅德島的時候還特地查過類似的症狀，感覺是精神方面的問題，不過她現在看起來還挺正常的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "上次祭典的時候我還以為她會來的，結果她沒來，我還挺遺憾的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "沒想到現在她開始自稱森蚺，既然她來了，上面這個人應該沒戲了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯勇士",
      "text": "咕哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "哈，果然，這傢伙也變強了啊，真想和現在的她打一架啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "果然，祖瑪瑪很強，但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "嗯？那邊的是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人",
      "text": "森蚺，我們來挑戰你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你們是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人",
      "text": "我是猛火部族的族長，烏代！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人",
      "text": "我是刀疤部族的族長，阿魯納！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏代&阿魯納",
      "text": "小的們，上來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你們要一起上嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏代",
      "text": "嘿，我們之間達成了協......什麼來著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿魯納",
      "text": "蠢貨，那叫協議！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏代",
      "text": "哦對，協議！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿魯納",
      "text": "可別以為你可以輕易當上大酋長！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我沒有這麼想過。不過，我沒聽說過你們有這麼團結。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏代",
      "text": "這是我們自己的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿魯納",
      "text": "嘿，我只是看不慣你這種搗鼓機器的傢伙來當大酋長！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "祭典可以上許多人的？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "誒？嗯，是的。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "博士，看你的表情，你該不會以為祭典是什麼擂台賽節目吧。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "難道不是一對一嗎？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "誒？這樣不會花很長時間嗎？",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "雖然很多時候為了尊嚴，大傢伙都是一對一的，但本身祭典唯一的規則就是無論用什麼手段，誰能贏到最後誰就是大酋長。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "帶小弟當然是最簡單有效的辦法了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "無論什麼手段？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "博士，你該不會也想上吧，我建議你放棄。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "啊，博士，你現在肯定在想些壞事吧。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "聽起來我也可以當酋長。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "哈哈哈，博士，很遺憾，你不行的。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "我說的無論用什麼手段，可不是博士你想的那些。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "我們這裡的人很單純的，不管幹啥，也只會想到帶很多人一起上。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "拐彎抹角的陰險招數在這裡可沒人會用。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "老實說，就算是我在羅德島待了好幾年，我也不擅長去搞那些小心思。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嗯，而且群毆也是有風險的呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "哈哈，沒錯，打完之後自己鬧內訌的事可不少見。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "而且另一方面，說是說所有手段都可以用，但是博士你可以真的試一試用你的手段解決其他人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "我保證最後是你會被群毆。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別把人說得那麼壞。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "哈哈哈，我只是實話實說。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "哈哈，能看到博士你翻白眼的樣子可真少見。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "民風淳樸啊。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "是啊，我也是出去了才知道，原來我的家鄉這麼淳樸。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "以前我可是覺得，所有地方的人都是一樣的。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "雖然我覺得博士你能做到讓所有人都察覺不到是你做的，但是，博士，你知道決定性的差異在哪裡嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "肌肉？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "沒錯！你看起來就很弱啊。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "喂，博士，別賭氣不聽我說話嘛！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "是可以這麼說，畢竟博士你看起來就弱不禁風的樣子。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "外表？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "總之呢，說白了，想要當上大酋長，其實只有一個條件。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "那就是——夠強，拳頭夠硬，夠能打！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "對吧，特米米？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "誒，嗯，嗯！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "不過真是怪了，我記得這兩個人可不是什麼好朋友，他們居然會聯手。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "唔唔，大概是在嘉維爾你離開後關係變好了吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "好吧，也有可能。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嗯？特米米，你不是說祖瑪瑪也是部族族長嗎，她的小弟呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "咦，這麼一說，確實呢，好像沒有看到多少她的部族的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "你看那邊，那些穿著不太一樣的就是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "咦，那些人裝備還挺不錯的，不過人確實少。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嘿，這傢伙，難道打算學我一個人把所有人打趴下嗎，有意思！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "這麼一說，特米米，你不是也要參加嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "誒，嗯，還不急。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "祖瑪瑪很厲害，刀疤族肯定打不過她的，先等她被消耗體力我再上。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嚯嚯，變聰明了啊，特米米。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "誒嘿嘿，我也是認真想要當上大酋長的！然後......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "然後？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "哦，等會兒再說吧，開打了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
